  "notes": "# OverCue 0.9.6\n\nFor CDJ-3000 firmware 3.22, supporting both hardware profiles.\n\n- Adds SD card support for prepared stems, stem waveforms, and vocal and phrase\n  indicators, both locally and through Pro DJ Link.\n- Enables playlist and beat-grid BPM editing on SD cards, including cards hosted\n  by other linked players running this update.\n\nExisting USB behavior and prepared stem media remain compatible. Close the SD\nslot cover after inserting a card, and unlock the card before saving edits.\n",
